Package: segqcc
Type: Package
Title: Change-Point Segmented Control Charts
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Detects change points in a control-chart statistic (via the
    'changepoint' package) and rebuilds the chart with the centre and the
    control limits recomputed within each homogeneous segment. Trending or
    regime-switching series are thereby assessed against locally appropriate
    limits instead of a single global set. Supports variable (xbar, R, S),
    individuals (xbar.one) and attribute (p, np, c, u) charts, and wraps
    'qcc'. The charted statistic is standardised before detection, which
    makes the change points invariant to the units of the data. Series that
    cannot be segmented return an ordinary single-segment chart with a
    warning rather than an error. Bundled deterministic example data sets
    (segxbar, segind, segp, segc) make the package self-contained.
